# Normalize line endings: LF in repo, native checkout
* text=auto

# Ensure shell scripts always use LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# Biome 与 CI 都按 LF 校验这些文件；显式声明 eol，避免 Windows 上
# core.autocrlf=true 时被检出成 CRLF，导致 npm run format:check 在本地失败。
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
